From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:01:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 057/167] hjviewer: ui: the shared parts the areas asked for

What the six areas asked of the shared files, after their work and after an independent
review of each:

- Tokens: hoverStrong (a hover on the canvas or the fill, where hover does not show) and
  dangerFill (a filled danger control with white on it).
- Theme: the dialogs' body text (14, line height 1.5, secondary colour); disabled checked
  boxes and disabled radios in the disabled colour; the dark theme's unchecked box border in
  the tertiary text colour; menus with the popup menus' shadow; the floating action button
  in the primary colour with its stronger hover; the window tab bar's hover in hoverStrong.
- common.dart (from the dialogs area): msgbox titles at 18/700 with a small icon in the
  palette's colours, a smaller connecting spinner, dialog buttons with their text only, the
  phone's quiet dialog buttons in the secondary colour; the error banner as a rounded callout
  in the danger tint; the combo box at the fields' radius and height, its menu as wide as the
  box with the current item tinted; the network error text in the danger colour.
- The home: the ID card's settings button is quiet until hovered; the set-password dialog
  takes the dialogs' title, its labels above the fields, a warning icon in the palette and
  the rules as tinted chips.
- Peer cards: the more button is quiet until hovered in both themes; Delete in the danger
  colour; the multi-select boxes in the theme's primary.
- The operator's tile on the phone in the app's typeface inside settings_ui.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
